  "releaseNotes": "- RSEndpoint(Of T): Updated header handling to use the shared header context for both sync (ExecWithHeaders) and async (ExecWithHeadersAsync) calls, added safer exception fallback (including response header extraction) and consistent error logging.\n\t\t  - RSEndpointHeaderContext: Introduced/standardized an AsyncLocal-based scope to store and propagate Token/TokenSID (and optional If-None-Match) across async flows, with proper cleanup after each call.\n\t\t  - RSEndpointHeaderInjector/RSEndpointHeaderInjectorBehavior: Implemented a client message inspector + endpoint behavior to inject HTTP headers reliably via HttpRequestMessageProperty, and to capture response headers (e.g., ETag / status code) for downstream use and caching scenarios.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
